# Perf / cost lock (FROZEN 2026-09-02)

Owner mandate: **minimal RAM**, **minimal Vercel spend**, **fast on all devices**, **no freeze/jank**.
Ponytail level: **`lite`** (not full/ultra unless owner says otherwise).

## Client RAM / speed

| Source | Lock |
| --- | --- |
| `app/src/lib/device-budget.ts` | `LITE_BOOT` sets `data-lite` on user lock (`sv-lite`), ≤4 GB RAM, ≤4 cores, Save-Data, reduced motion |
| Map caps | `mapRuntimeOptions()`: lite tile cache 16, full 48; pixelRatio cap; no resource timing / preserveDrawingBuffer |
| Regression guard | `device-budget.check.ts` — run on change; build fails if locks break |
| Heavy UI | Dynamic import maps (`Map3DLazy`), listing `MapEmbed` lazy, lite skips reveal + GTM |
| Listing/search clients | Import `map-geo` / `map-href` — never `buildings.ts` or `geocode.ts` (footprints + streets JSON) |
| Motion | `reducedMotion="user"` in I18nProvider — never `"never"` |

## Server / Vercel

| Source | Lock |
| --- | --- |
| `app/vercel.json` | Per-route `memory` + `maxDuration` — do not bump without owner approval |
| Default API routes | 256 MB / short timeout unless listed |
| Hot paths | search/map-data/ai/cron: 1024 MB max — already ceiling |
| DB pool | `src/lib/db.ts` `max: 1` — one connection per lambda |
| Runtime | Fluid Compute (Node), **not** `runtime = 'edge'` unless required |
| Region | `fra1` only unless multi-region approved |
| Sentry | `replaysSessionSampleRate: 0` |

## Agent rules (ponytail lite)

1. **Deletion over addition** — no new deps, bundles, or serverless routes without measuring need.
2. **Lazy load** heavy client chunks; SSR only what LCP needs.
3. **Cache** at CDN/ISR before adding compute; prefer static/JSON over live API.
4. **No polling** `performance.memory`; detect once via `LITE_BOOT` / `isLiteDevice()`.
5. **No background work** on main thread — ResizeObserver/debounce for map resize only.
6. Change `device-budget.ts`, `vercel.json`, or `db.ts` pool → update `device-budget.check.ts` in same PR.

Change locks only with explicit owner approval + date bump here.
